</main><footer>Sports Edge Lab · Public aggregate review · Self-contained; no network requests, tracking, credentials, private observations or individual football forecasts. Download this HTML and open it in a browser; GitHub's file viewer displays source.<noscript> JavaScript is required for comparisons and invented scenarios. The status summary and linked JSON evidence remain available.</noscript></footer>
